  "description": "“Seon-nyeo. You resemble me, so you must help people.”\n\nBefore my mother’s teachings, I made the same vow every time.\nThat I would not live as a shaman like her.\n\nThe place I arrived at after dying while desperately avoiding the gods, was a Western romance fantasy world where such vows weren’t even necessary!\n\nBut then…\n\n[Can you hear my voice? From now on, you are the Saintess we have appointed!]\n\nNo, why is the god here calling me Seong-nyeo(saintess) again?!\n\n===\n\n[Your late grandmother is wandering around that man.]\n“My James, have you been doing well?”\n\n“G-grandma…?!”\n\nI flaunted a flashy wrist snap and shook the bell.\n\n“The woman you’re trying to marry… Absolutely not!”\n\nI’m someone who died after rejecting this kind of life in my previous life. So why am I doing this now?\n\nAnd on top of that, when I went to meet the emperor as the god ordered, the killing intent he gave off was no joke.\n\n“To call someone a Saintess straight out of some ancient legend. This isn’t child’s play.”\n\nTo stop the destruction of the world, I have to persuade this man?\n\nWhy does it have to be a religion hater of all people!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/68491618), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%84%B1%EB%85%80%EA%B0%80-%EC%95%84%EB%8B%88%EB%9D%BC-%EC%84%A0%EB%85%80%EC%9D%B8%EB%8D%B0%EC%9A%94/4763)\n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/204680)",
